  "created": "2025-08-23T20:21:11.307Z",
  "description": "A powerful framework that allows creating user-defined functions for Mathcad 15 and Mathcad Prime using any .NET language (C#, VB.NET, F#).\n\nThis package provides a simple, attribute-based API that hides the complexity of the underlying C++/CLI host. Developers can write clean, strongly-typed functions by inheriting from a generic base class, focusing purely on their logic without boilerplate code.\n\nFeatures:\n- Supports string, Complex, and Complex[,] data types.\n- Automatically handles marshalling between .NET and Mathcad.\n- Provides an API for custom error handling, logging, and user interrupt checks.\n- Includes the native C++/CLI host (netefi.dll) which is automatically copied to the output directory.",
  "id": "NetEFI.Framework",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2025-08-23T20:24:18.12Z",
  "licenseExpression": "MIT",
  "licenseUrl": "https://licenses.nuget.org/MIT",
  "listed": true,
  "packageHash": "1W3XssKDZamTD3itfG/siMkF/VZ3XjDmLFa9MLqH9a/aDnQr729xEwUabWCXFH7TOdo8RtNkNIh3zli2L3vjZw==",
  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 169467,
  "projectUrl": "https://github.com/ViacheslavMezentsev/NetEFI",
  "published": "2025-08-23T20:21:11.307Z",
  "readmeFile": "docs\\readme.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 0.4.0 introduces a major, breaking architectural refactoring for a vastly improved developer experience.\n\n**New Architecture:**\n- The old `IComputable` interface is now an internal detail.\n- Developers now create functions by inheriting from a new generic base class (`MathcadFunction<...>` in the `NetEFI.Functions` namespace).\n- This provides a simple, strongly-typed `Execute(...)` method, removing the need to work with `object[]` arrays and `out` parameters.\n- Function metadata (name, parameters, description) is now declared declaratively using the `[Computable]` attribute.\n\n**BREAKING CHANGES:**\n- All existing user functions must be rewritten to use the new `MathcadFunction` base class and `[Computable]` attribute. Please see the project's readme file for examples.\n- The `IComputable` interface has been changed and is no longer meant for direct implementation.",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": false,
  "title": "NetEFI Framework for Mathcad",
  "verbatimVersion": "0.4.0",
